      "content": "Okay, I see. My instructors are concerned that these descriptions might be too vague for rookies. They want to be able to recognize these patterns instantly during a patrol. To make this more practical, could you provide some more descriptive, visual examples? For instance, what are some common ways people in these urban environments dress or carry themselves when they're involved in illicit activities or \"street\" culture vs. just being regular citizens? I want to help the officers distinguish between someone just being part of the local culture and someone actually exhibiting suspicious \"street\" behaviors.",
